  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229548,"global_rank":113730},{"name":"Avynn/Cat-GAN","owner":"Avynn","html_url":"https://github.com/Avynn/Cat-GAN","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"a generative adverserial network created to identify and generate cats","topics":[],"score":229520,"global_rank":113773},{"name":"bcov77/pipeline_for_diversify","owner":"bcov77","html_url":"https://github.com/bcov77/pipeline_for_diversify","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229520,"global_rank":113775},{"name":"tylerl/SublimeFilters","owner":"tylerl","html_url":"https://github.com/tylerl/SublimeFilters","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"My custom filters for the SublimeText FilterPipes plugin","topics":[],"score":229511,"global_rank":113785},{"name":"AllenInstitute/np_copy","owner":"AllenInstitute","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenInstitute/np_copy","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229510,"global_rank":113787},{"name":"sdorminey/tunnel-pals","owner":"sdormine